<div class="aq-page" data-theme="dark">
<section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Seven system families</h2><p class="aq-lead">Each page gives limits, design parameters, options and documents. Or send your user requirement specification (URS) and we map the whole path.</p></header><ol class="aq-rows aq-linkgrid"><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-pw" data-wp="sys-pw"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">Purified Water (PW) generation</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Reverse osmosis (RO) and electrodeionization (EDI) skids: PW below 1.3 <span class="aq-unit">µ</span>S/cm at 25 °C and 500 ppb total organic carbon (TOC), hot water sanitizable.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">USP &lt;645&gt;</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-wfi-distillation" data-wp="sys-wfi-distillation"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/still.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/still.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">WFI by distillation</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Multi-effect and vapour compression stills making hot WFI at &lt; 0.25 EU/mL endotoxin.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">USP &lt;85&gt;</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-wfi-membrane" data-wp="sys-wfi-membrane"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/edi.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/edi.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">WFI by membrane</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Double-pass RO, EDI and ultrafiltration (UF): ambient WFI without plant steam for generation.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">Ph. Eur. 0169</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-pure-steam" data-wp="sys-pure-steam"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/pure-steam.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/pure-steam.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">Pure steam generators</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Condensate that meets WFI limits; steam that passes EN 285 at the sterilizer.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">EN 285</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-storage" data-wp="sys-storage"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">Storage and distribution loops</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Turbulent flow at peak draw, branches at L/D ≤ 2, hot WFI loops above 70 °C, ambient loops sanitized by heat or ozone.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">ASME BPE</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-pretreatment" data-wp="sys-pretreatment"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/softener.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/softener.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">Pretreatment</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Media, softening and carbon or bisulfite: no detectable chlorine or chloramine at the RO inlet, silt density index (SDI) ≤ 3.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">USP &lt;1231&gt;</span></span></p></a></li><li><a class="aq-rows__row" href="#sys-monitoring" data-wp="sys-monitoring"><span class="aq-rows__lead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/toc.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/toc.png)"></span></span><h3 class="aq-rows__t">Monitoring and controls</h3><p class="aq-rows__d">Online TOC and conductivity on the raw reading; audit trails that meet 21 CFR Part 11 and EU GMP Annex 11.<span class="aq-tags"><span class="aq-tag">21 CFR Part 11</span></span></p></a></li></ol><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(32px,1fr));gap:24px;justify-items:center"><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/softener.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/softener.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/carbon-filter.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/carbon-filter.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ro-membrane.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/edi.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/edi.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/still.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/still.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/pure-steam.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/pure-steam.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/tank.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/tank.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/loop.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/valve.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/valve.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/heat-exchanger.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/heat-exchanger.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/uv.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/uv.png)"></span><span class="aq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/icons/ozone.png);mask-image:url(assets/icons/ozone.png)"></span><span class="aq